{% if kind == "planner" -%}
Act as the planner/orchestrator: split the goal, define worker briefs, and set acceptance checks for this bounded pass.
{% elif kind == "executor" -%}
Execute the work described by the planner/orchestrator for this bounded pass.
{% elif kind == "verifier" -%}
Verify the result and report evidence.
{% elif kind == "reviewer" -%}
Review the goal output as '{{ worker_id }}', preserving risks, dissent, missing evidence, and follow-up recommendations.
{% else -%}
Complete the '{{ worker_id }}' worker slice.
{% endif -%}
